%% Offline synchronization sequence (UML sequence, informal)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant OB as Outbox (Drift)
  participant FS as Firestore SDK (local cache + queue)
  participant SR as Firestore server + rules
  participant FN as Cloud Function trigger
  OB->>FS: write doc with deterministic id (status written_local)
  Note over FS: offline - write queued locally
  FS-->>SR: connectivity restored, flush queue
  SR->>SR: rules: owner, shape, request.time window
  alt accepted
    SR-->>FS: ack
    FS-->>OB: snapshot hasPendingWrites=false (acknowledged)
    SR->>FN: onDocumentCreated (at-least-once)
    FN->>SR: ledger create-if-absent (deterministic id)
  else permission-denied on create-only path
    SR-->>FS: reject, local write rolled back
    FS-->>OB: error
    OB->>SR: read doc
    alt exists with same payloadHash
      OB->>OB: acknowledged (duplicate retry)
    else
      OB->>OB: needs_attention (visible to user)
    end
  end
